config CONSOLE
    bool "Serial console"
    default y if !RELEASE || MFG
    help
      Text console on the board's console port, CONSOLE_UART: logs and
      the shell. Off on release firmware, which leaves the port unused.

config CONSOLE_BAUDRATE
    int "Console baud rate"
    depends on CONSOLE
    default 1000000
    help
      Line rate of the board's console port, CONSOLE_UART.
